        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our key design centers are in Switzerland, Ireland, the United States, and Taiwan, where we have internal teams of designers who work in close collaboration with our engineering, product and manufacturing teams throughout our innovation process.",
